Deep Agents currently exposes declarative subagents supplied through subagents=[...] through its built-in task tool;
isolated context is the default mode.

The main concept this program demonstrates is:

Main Agent
=
Understands the overall problem

Subagent
=
Handles one specialized subtask

task tool
=
Delegates the work

Subagent result
=
Returned to main agent

Main Agent
=
Produces final answer